BOUNCEHARVEST — Piezo/Solar Hybrid Trampoline
BEKW-CODE Open Hardware Specification — v1.0
Class: Dual-Mode Kinetic/Solar Harvester — Playground Infrastructure License: None. Open-source. Take it, build it, improve it, give it away again.
0. THE CORE INVERSION
A trampoline sits idle 20+ hours a day and, while in use, converts a genuinely large amount of kid-generated kinetic energy straight into heat and mat-flex with zero recovery. Both states are currently wasted. This unit harvests both: the bounce mat's flex when kids are jumping, and the sun hitting the same surface area when they're not — same footprint, two harvesting modes, and the honest energy math to back it, not hype.
